# The transducer role — the middle of a causal chain: a gene amplified/inhibited by an upstream gene
# AND itself acting on a downstream one relays the signal. The tragedy-cascade's plot runs through it.
# y re-binds in SUBJECT position of antecedent 2 (not object), so the chain fires (contract §3).
if x amplifies y and y amplifies z then y becomes transducer
if x inhibits y and y inhibits z then y becomes transducer
